req	Level 10 Construction
step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Effigy</col> south of <col=800000>East Ardougne</col> (south-west of <col=800000>fairy ring</col> DJP, <col=800000>Ardougne cloak</col> <col=800000>monastery</col> teleport and walk east, or minigame teleport to Fishing Trawler and walk north) to begin the quest.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Talk to Effigy south of East Ardougne (south-west of fairy ring DJP, Ardougne cloak monastery teleport and walk east, or minigame teleport to Fishing Trawler and walk north) to begin the quest.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Bonafido</col> at the tower's entrance. He will ask to get a <col=800000>builder's costume</col>.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Talk to Effigy south of East Ardougne (south-west of fairy ring DJP, Ardougne cloak monastery teleport and walk east, or minigame teleport to Fishing Trawler and walk north) to begin the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Bonafido at the tower's entrance. He will ask to get a builder's costume.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Wear the full costume. Talk to Bonafido and answer his questions.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Talk to Effigy south of East Ardougne (south-west of fairy ring DJP, Ardougne cloak monastery teleport and walk east, or minigame teleport to Fishing Trawler and walk north) to begin the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Bonafido at the tower's entrance. He will ask to get a builder's costume.</str>
line	
line	<str>Wear the full costume. Talk to Bonafido and answer his questions.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Enter the tower while still wearing the full costume</col>
